Publish ConnectX v0.3.0-alpha.3 only from the exact main commit after the standalone release workflow runs scripts/verify-alpha3-local.sh --clean --device on Android 35 x86_64 and passes every build, strategy, evidence, JNI, TCP, UDP and DNS gate.

The release workflow builds, verifies, packages and publishes in one run without polling or cross-workflow artifact handoff.
